title: "NaN-EcoNet: The Agentic Green Ecosystem for Autonomous Waste Logistics & Circular 4-Win Economy"
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-26"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/chinhanxt/NaN-EcoNet"
url: "https://github.com/chinhanxt/NaN-EcoNet"
abstract: >-
  NaN-EcoNet is an integrated, agentic green ecosystem uniting autonomous waste logistics,
  high-performance vehicle routing optimization (3D-PACO and Google OR-Tools CVRPTW),
  computer vision AI for bulky item classification and dimension estimation (Gemini 2.5 Flash),
  Model Context Protocol (MCP) enterprise business intelligence, and a circular 4-Win reward
  platform that seamlessly bridges citizens, municipal operators, recycling aggregators, and
  commercial brands under Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) compliance.
